<title>USA: TABLE-CFSB Bancorp Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-CFSB Bancorp Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LANSING, Mich. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>					 Q2		   Six Months</p>
<p>				1997	 1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net income		2,796	1,851     5,103	 3,566</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share:*</p>
<p> Primary		    0.52	 0.33	0.95	  0.64</p>
<p> Fully diluted	    0.52	 0.33	0.95	  0.64</p>
<p>NOTE: Assets at June 30, 1997, $845.4 million vs $791.6 million.</p>
<p>Loans receivable, net $745.1 million vs $670.0 million.</p>
<p>Deposits $560.4 million vs $537.5 million.</p>
<p>*Common shares outstanding and per share amounts restated for 1996 periods to reflect 10 percent stock dividends declared in August 1996 and May 1997.</p>
